{"artifacts":[],"cancelled_at":null,"effects":[],"expected_sha":"5f81f28f939a6e697a31f86de9606457dd74d36e","generation":4,"intent":{"claim":"56c2a60c889341d3bc244dfbddc44275","dispatch_status":"uncertain","id":"1694585079b949949797f0d4a79143ce","recorded_at":1791427571},"iteration":1,"next_check_at":1791427871,"phase":"38d160382c7047c8a4271e43f294148c","publications":[],"reason":null,"report":null,"request":{"authorized_actor_id":218610,"baseline_review_ids":[5437480319,5437847872,5447139977,5450772447],"budgets":{"deadline_seconds":7200,"max_iterations":5,"propagation_seconds":120,"retention_days":14,"worker_timeout_minutes":30},"commit_author":{"id":218610,"login":"trask"},"deadline":1791434769,"findings":[{"body":"<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### \ud83d\udfe1 Changes recommended\n\nFlow-returning `@WithSpan` instrumentation remains enabled through the existing Flow module, contradicting the new default.\n\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>2 open findings</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Move Flow instrumentation under the default-off selector](#discussion_r4214073404) \u00b7 New\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Low severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Document all removed public selector aliases](#discussion_r4214073442) \u00b7 New\n</details>\n\n\ud83e\udde0 **Review effort:** Balanced\n\n---\n\nGive feedback about Copilot approvals in [this survey](https://survey.alchemer.com/s3/9011660/CCR-Public-Preview-Autoapprove-feedback-survey) to enter a drawing for a $150 gift card.","comment_id":null,"key":"review:5450772447","kind":"body","line":null,"path":null,"review_id":5450772447},{"body":"[Javaagent] This selector only controls the suspend-function module. `KotlinCoroutinesFlowInstrumentationModule` remains default-enabled under `kotlinx-coroutines` and registers the Flow async-end strategy used by the default-enabled generic `@WithSpan` instrumentation, so methods returning `Flow` still receive full `@WithSpan` instrumentation by default. This contradicts the new documented default and the claim that the broad selector no longer enables annotations. Move the Flow registration under the same default-off selector (and cover the Flow operation in the disabled JVM).","comment_commit_id":"5f81f28f939a6e697a31f86de9606457dd74d36e","comment_id":4214073404,"key":"inline:4214073404","kind":"inline","line":22,"original_commit_id":"5f81f28f939a6e697a31f86de9606457dd74d36e","original_line":22,"path":"instrumentation/kotlinx-coroutines/kotlinx-coroutines-1.0/javaagent/src/main/java/io/opentelemetry/javaagent/instrumentation/kotlinxcoroutines/v1_0/instrumentationannotations/AnnotationInstrumentationModule.java","review_commit_id":"5f81f28f939a6e697a31f86de9606457dd74d36e","review_id":5450772447,"review_submitted_at":"2026-10-08T02:44:33Z","root_author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"thread_context":[{"author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"body_hash":"887093ed75b27decded34249f1c104baa7ad989ec814db8fed98e8bbbdd09f80","id":4214073404,"parent":null,"updated_at":"2026-10-08T02:44:33Z"}],"thread_id":"PRRT_kwDODJKVX86qLGki"},{"body":"[Config] This breaking-change note omits several removed public selectors from the constructors. Users who run with global instrumentation disabled and explicitly enable `kafka-clients-metrics-0.11`, `kafka-clients-0.11`, `kotlinx-coroutines-1.0`, `kotlinx-coroutines-opentelemetry-instrumentation-annotations`, or `opentelemetry-instrumentation-annotations` are also affected, but the migration note currently does not identify those configurations. List every removed alias so those users can migrate to the dedicated selectors.","comment_commit_id":"5f81f28f939a6e697a31f86de9606457dd74d36e","comment_id":4214073442,"key":"inline:4214073442","kind":"inline","line":11,"original_commit_id":"5f81f28f939a6e697a31f86de9606457dd74d36e","original_line":11,"path":"CHANGELOG.md","review_commit_id":"5f81f28f939a6e697a31f86de9606457dd74d36e","review_id":5450772447,"review_submitted_at":"2026-10-08T02:44:33Z","root_author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"thread_context":[{"author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"body_hash":"f08147eb2f23138661f83c44b454d9f8f07ad095cf1234f9043cedea6bbe91de","id":4214073442,"parent":null,"updated_at":"2026-10-08T02:44:33Z"}],"thread_id":"PRRT_kwDODJKVX86qLGk6"}],"frozen_at":1791427569,"frozen_at_iso":"2026-10-08T02:46:09Z","frozen_sha":"5f81f28f939a6e697a31f86de9606457dd74d36e","head_ref":"copilot/adopt-kafka-metrics-coroutine-defaults","head_repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","head_repo_id":210933087,"launch_run":{"actor_id":218610,"attempt":1,"id":37719466535},"loop_kind":"copilot_review","mode":"publish","pr":20428,"pr_author_id":198982749,"protocol":"reviewable-v1","publication":{"auth_mode":"fine_grained_pat","authorized_actor_id":218610,"authorized_at":1791427571,"continuation_deadline":1791434771,"generation":4,"max_pipelines":5,"phase":"38d160382c7047c8a4271e43f294148c","profile":"reviewable-v1","required_checks":["Analyze (actions)","Analyze Ja